  solarPanelNarrationText: Two circular solar arrays supplied the lander's electricity
    on Mars.
  cameraMastNarrationText: SEIS listened for marsquakes; the robotic arm placed it
    on the Martian ground.
  instrumentArmNarrationText: The arm placed SEIS and HP3 on the surface so they
    could measure shaking and heat flow.
  systemsCheckNarrationText: 'Solar power, seismometer, robotic arm: InSight is ready
    to begin its mission.'
